Like the reference to rogue, this is an homage to a much older computer 
game, namely colossal cave (i.e., advent), the first computer game I ever 
played (way back in the late '70s at Fresno State). The message appears in 
the South side chamber of the Hall of Mists, and refers to the large gold
nugget found there, which is indeed too heavy to hump up the stairs, but 
which can be taken back to the well-house from Y2 by means of the magic word.

